WEBVTT

00:02:59.842 --> 00:03:01.719
are dying at an alarming rate.

00:03:01.761 --> 00:03:05.765
But almost nobody makes it to 85 or 90.

00:03:06.682 --> 00:03:11.437
And more than half of the population
is dead by the age of 45.

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:16.317
How many people in this room
are older than 45?

00:03:17.193 --> 00:03:21.239
Right? And think about that:
half of you would not be here.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.573
We talk about optimism.

00:03:22.615 --> 00:03:25.868
That is the most fundamental form
of good news there is.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:26.911
(Laughter)

00:03:26.953 --> 00:03:28.871
You are not dead. Right?

00:03:28.913 --> 00:03:30.790
(Laughter)